[{:db/id "q-140359/selection/a51b29cf569779ddb8024a435c77fb88c1da0e5481d82a90a62a364109a76015" :answer/id #uuid "00f989ad-59c6-50b2-bbb9-91f3995639cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 10 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140359/selection/937e1abdb593a1fd8bf59ed0493680f2b1fbdd323d425fc27f8318d7c6fa606f" :answer/id #uuid "415186a7-3a45-516c-9286-ff516885451a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 10 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140359/selection/86dd0e21d807f6c93ca43c43e91fe353fdbb64b1372811b012ba91de3be2ba35" :answer/id #uuid "51e99ae2-e627-546c-a495-5289906e5285" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140359/selection/26aedc6cbb0a15cb542862b96786b104e77a247a93dd40ba142c57fc8cfa1f1f" :answer/id #uuid "639dd7db-a874-54db-8b28-e018d8685f19" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140359/selection/49f3d71d7af37b35943605e6cf4f3f9d3761149059502947d8d170c29bfea966" :answer/id #uuid "8e5426be-02ed-5894-8c79-a550bcc36071" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140359/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "535f9c27-081c-51bc-b3a7-d639bdb5e1e5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-140359/selection/937e1abdb593a1fd8bf59ed0493680f2b1fbdd323d425fc27f8318d7c6fa606f" :answer-field/choices ["q-140359/selection/a51b29cf569779ddb8024a435c77fb88c1da0e5481d82a90a62a364109a76015" "q-140359/selection/937e1abdb593a1fd8bf59ed0493680f2b1fbdd323d425fc27f8318d7c6fa606f" "q-140359/selection/86dd0e21d807f6c93ca43c43e91fe353fdbb64b1372811b012ba91de3be2ba35" "q-140359/selection/26aedc6cbb0a15cb542862b96786b104e77a247a93dd40ba142c57fc8cfa1f1f" "q-140359/selection/49f3d71d7af37b35943605e6cf4f3f9d3761149059502947d8d170c29bfea966"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-140359" :question/id #uuid "844e86f7-1f0f-5f3f-bcdf-abc293b831b7" :question/math-academy-id "q-140359" :question/problem "Consider the vector $x$ and the plane $r=sv+tw,$ where $s,t\\in R,$ and\n\n$$\nv=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,w=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}],\\,\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 14 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFind the orthogonal projection of $x$ onto the plane given that $v⊥w.$" :question/worked-solution "Since our plane passes through the origin, it defines the subspace $S=\\text{Span}{v,w}$ in ${R}^{3}.$ \nAnd, since the set ${v,w}$ is orthogonal, the orthogonal projection of $x$ onto the subspace $S$ is given by \n\n$$\n{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x={\\text{proj}}_{v}\\,x+{\\text{proj}}_{w}\\,x.\n$$\n\nSo, we first find the orthogonal projections of $x$ onto $\\text{Span}{{a}_{1}}$ and $\\text{Span}{{a}_{2}}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{v}\\,x & =\\frac{x\\cdot v}{v\\cdot v}v=\\frac{4\\cdot 3+14\\cdot 2+(-2)\\cdot (-1)}{{3}^{2}+{2}^{2}+(-1)^{2}}v=3[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {\\text{proj}}_{w}\\,x & =\\frac{x\\cdot w}{w\\cdot w}w=\\frac{4\\cdot (-2)+14\\cdot 2+(-2)\\cdot (-2)}{(-2)^{2}+{2}^{2}+(-2)^{2}}w=2[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x & ={\\text{proj}}_{v}\\,x+{\\text{proj}}_{w}\\,x \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 10 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-140359/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "acb4bd03-9b89-5775-a700-e1f3ea9fa62e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-140359"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
